Problem state, version 14
Goal: Design a deep geothermal plant for the 2027 heating and cooling demand profiles of the GEMINI hackathon challenge, meeting all challenge requirements (R1-R8), then verify, analyse and explain it.
Requirement R1 [set]: Maximum production flow 300 m3/h per doublet (hard challenge cap) (case requirement max_production_flow)
Requirement R2 [set]: Minimum stable flow while active 50 m3/h per doublet (hard challenge cap) (case requirement min_stable_flow)
Requirement R3 [set]: Maximum geothermal brine cooling 40 °C, producer to injector (hard challenge cap) (case requirement max_brine_cooling)
Requirement R4 [set]: Pump hydraulic efficiency 70 % (simplified) (case requirement pump_hydraulic_efficiency)
Requirement R5 [set]: Production / injection volume balance required: equal liquid volumes, same reservoir (case requirement reinjection_balance)
Requirement R6 [set]: Annual operation of geothermal doublet 330 daily steps (case requirement annual_operation_limit)
Requirement R7 [set]: Supply temperature to the demand (heating) 100 °C, fixed (case requirement heating_supply_temperature)
Requirement R8 [set]: Supply temperature to the demand (cooling) 20 °C, fixed (case requirement cooling_supply_temperature)
Assumption answer.f1279dd1 [confirmed, user]: The user was asked: The two demand files (GEMINI_Heating_Demand_Daily_2027.csv and GEMINI_Cooling_Demand_Daily_2027.csv) give their dates as bare dates (2027-01-01 … 2027-12-31) with no offset, and the challenge PDF names no site, so no time zone can be read from the files. Which time zone should the case's daily serie... The user answered: I do not know the site, so I do not know the time zone. The files are daily values. Please use UTC as a clearly labelled assumption and mark it as unconfirmed in the case. = "I do not know the site, so I do not know the time zone. The files are daily values. Please use UTC as a clearly labelled assumption and mark it as unconfirmed in the case.", because the user's answer to ask_user; do not ask it again
Assumption answer.fdd8cf22 [confirmed, user]: The user was asked: The challenge PDF names no site, location or elevation, so the outside-air conditions cannot be read from the files (the knowledge base has no site data either). Please give, or say "unknown" for any you cannot:
1. site.air.temperature — outside air temperature, constant in °C (or a series file)
2. ... The user answered: I do not know any of these; the challenge gives no site. Please propose sourced values (source, publisher, year) or a clearly labelled assumption, and I will approve or reject. = "I do not know any of these; the challenge gives no site. Please propose sourced values (source, publisher, year) or a clearly labelled assumption, and I will approve or reject.", because the user's answer to ask_user; do not ask it again
