Assumption A14 [confirmed, agent]: utilities.electricity.import_limit = "20 MW", because engineering assumption, no source, approved by the user: the brief states no grid connection limit.; source: {"origin": "agent assumption"}
Assumption A15 [confirmed, agent]: utilities.electricity.export_limit = "0 MW", because engineering assumption, no source, approved by the user: the brief states no export capability, so no export is assumed.; source: {"origin": "agent assumption"}
