Assumption D2 [confirmed, agent]: Boiler backup policy params.backup = peak: the doublet may run at most 330 d/yr (case requirement annual_operation_limit), so on the remaining days the electric boiler must carry the whole heating load, not only the part the doublet cannot reach. = "peak"
Assumption D3 [confirmed, agent]: Optimisation objective = lcts (levelised cost of thermal supply), the single cost metric that covers both the heat and the cold the plant sells; evaluations 30, seed 0. = "lcts, 30 evaluations, seed 0"
Assumption D4 [confirmed, agent]: Plant schedule rules (mine, not the case's): params.control.dispatch = least_cost and params.control.outages = lowest_demand, the single value each of gemini's suggestions, so the 35 non-operating days fall on the lowest heating demand. = "dispatch least_cost, outages lowest_demand"
